<title>INDONESIA: Mas Murni says 1996 net 4.01 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Mas Murni says 1996 net 4.01 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31</p>
<p>			     (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>		 Net profit			 4.01   vs   3.79</p>
<p>		 Earnings per share (in rph)    25   vs     24</p>
<p>		 Total revenues		  44.70   vs  35.92</p>
<p>		 Operating profit		15.99   vs   8.24</p>
<p>		 Gross profit		    27.43   vs  21.90</p>
<p>		 Retained earnings	     18.37   vs  15.46</p>
<p>NOTE : The results were audited. PT Mas Murni Indonesia is a property company.</p>
</text>
